#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_PREP_TARGETS.rst:2
msgid "CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_PREP_TARGETS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_PREP_TARGETS.rst:6
msgid ""
"Do not generate ``install_prep/<component>`` and ``install_prep/all`` build "
"targets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_PREP_TARGETS.rst:9
msgid ""
"When this variable is set to a true value, CMake does not generate the "
"preparation targets that build the known prerequisites of a subsequent "
"component-specific or full installation, even when using a generator that "
"supports them.  See :ref:`Install Preparation Targets`.  The preparation "
"targets are also not generated if the project has no install rules or :"
"variable:`CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RULES` is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_PREP_TARGETS.rst:16
msgid ""
"Set this variable in the top-level directory.  It is off by default, in "
"which case the preparation targets are generated."
msgstr ""
